Subject: [PATCH 1/3] docs: update CLAUDE.md fuzzing section for the new
 analysis/lint targets

Two sentences in the Test Infrastructure section were falsified by this
branch and are brought back in line with the code:

- FuzzLSPSession is no longer the only target reaching analysis/ and
  lint/: FuzzAnalyzeSource, FuzzWorkspaceScan and FuzzLintSource now
  fuzz those packages directly, while FuzzLSPSession remains the only
  whole-session LSP target.
- EnvMacroExpander.ExpandMacro's recover is no longer uncovered: the
  expander counts aborted calls via a frame-local completion flag
  (analysis.PanicReporter), and the LSP harness's checkExpansionPanics
  fails on any swallowed expansion panic.
